cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "surfscape: Composition and Configuration in Continuous Landscape Surfaces"
message: "If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Rahimi
    given-names: Ehsan
  - family-names: Jung
    given-names: Chuleui
version: 0.3.0
license: GPL-3.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/ehsanrahimi666/surfscape"
abstract: >-
  An R package to test whether continuous landscape metrics respond to the
  values present in a landscape window (composition), to their spatial
  arrangement (configuration), or to both, using controlled changes and
  simulated landscapes, and to decompose the change in a metric between two
  dates into compositional and configurational components.
keywords:
  - landscape ecology
  - landscape metrics
  - gradient surface model
  - composition
  - configuration
